Malicious client Manipulates updates Poisoning of agency indicators
External observer Observes traffic Metadata leakage of intervention patterns
Colluding clients Combine updates Reconstruction of individual review behavior
Model inversion attacker Queries model Recovery of training-data agency patterns
Membership inference attacker Queries model Presence disclosure of specific agency events

