Appendix N — Implementation Roadmap

N.1 Purpose

To specify a phased design roadmap for HAP implementation.

N.2 Phases

Phase Name Design Deliverables Gate to Next Phase
0 Charter Governance rules, scope clause, failure-mode register External methodological review
1 Indicator dictionary Full Appendix B records; source mapping Peer review of indicators
