N.3 Design Constraints (Non-Negotiable)

1. No data is accessed before the pre-registration is timestamped.
2. No metric is selected by a data contributor.
3. No scalar is published without the uncertainty contract (Appendix M.4).
4. No agency dimension is published without the uncertainty contract (Appendix D).
5. No submission employing DP alone or SPM alone is accepted.
6. No failure is hidden.

